Kino plugin "MundoDonghua". Site behaviour (the list pages, the series pages and the players of an episode, which sit in packed scripts) was
read from the live site and from the CloudStream provider "MundoDonghuaProvider" in redblacker8/storm-ext (a fork of
Stormunblessed/storm-ext); no code was copied from it. The packer reader and the request helper are adapted from the Kino plugin
"Latino" (xuper-plugin/kino-plugin-latino, Apache-2.0), by the same author.
